<title>THAILAND: Siam Panich takes stake in Thanakij Insurance Co.</title>
<headline>Siam Panich takes stake in Thanakij Insurance Co.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Siam Panich Leasing Plc said on Monday it has bought a 30 million baht ($1.15 million) stake in new insurance firm Thanakij Insurance Co Ltd.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Stock Exchange of Thailand Siam Panich Leasing Plc said it had bought three million shares at 10 baht each with the purchase financed by loans and working capital.</p>
<p>Thanakij Insurance Co Ltd's total registered capital was 300 million baht, the statement said.</p>
<p>($1 = 26 baht)</p>
</text>
